  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Apps\n* Bump `net_conduit_tcp` from `1.2.5` to `1.2.6`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_tcp/1.2.5...net_conduit_tcp/1.2.6)\n* Bump `net_conduit_websocket` from `1.2.5` to `1.2.6`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_websocket/1.2.5...net_conduit_websocket/1.2.6)\n* Bump `net_conduit_udp` from `1.2.5` to `1.2.6`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_udp/1.2.5...net_conduit_udp/1.2.6)\n* Bump `net_conduit_ipc` from `1.2.5` to `1.2.6`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_ipc/1.2.5...net_conduit_ipc/1.2.6)\n* Bump `net_conduit_quic` from `1.2.5` to `1.2.6`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_quic/1.2.5...net_conduit_quic/1.2.6)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Add detailed disconnection handling and graceful shutdown by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/28\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/build.20251206223955.a8b03bf...build.20251207012826.106270b",
